&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PLOS is a nonprofit Open Access publisher with an ambitious mission: to help transform research communication so that science can be shared, understood and used more effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Research publishing is changing rapidly. Researchers&#39; expectations are changing. Technology is creating possibilities that&amp;nbsp;didn&#39;t&amp;nbsp;exist a few years ago. And at PLOS&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;rethinking some of the services, systems and assumptions that have shaped scholarly publishing for decades.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;That means there are interesting product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to solve - not just features to deliver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;take responsibility for a product area and work with designers,&amp;nbsp;engineers&amp;nbsp;and colleagues across PLOS to understand the problems that matter, work out where we can make the greatest difference and help the team learn its way towards good solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be joining active product teams working on significant problems and will have plenty of opportunity to shape what we do and how we do it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How we work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We want our product teams to be curious, evidence-led&amp;nbsp;and comfortable with uncertainty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;expect a Product Manager to arrive with all the answers. We do expect them to ask good questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;use continuous discovery alongside delivery: spending time with users, looking at data, understanding the wider service,&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;assumptions&amp;nbsp;and finding practical ways to test them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;help the team break large problems into smaller things we can learn from, rather than waiting until everything is known before we release something.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;And&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;make the team&#39;s thinking visible - explaining what&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;trying to achieve, what&amp;nbsp;we&#39;ve&amp;nbsp;learned, what&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;uncertain about and why&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;making the choices we are.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Senior Product Manager,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Understand the problem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build a deep understanding of our users, their&amp;nbsp;needs&amp;nbsp;and behaviours, as well as the organisational,&amp;nbsp;operational&amp;nbsp;and technical context surrounding them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Shape product direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work out where the greatest opportunities lie within your area and help translate PLOS&#39;s&amp;nbsp;objectives&amp;nbsp;into clear product outcomes and priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practise continuous discovery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work closely with design, engineering and others to explore problems,&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;assumptions&amp;nbsp;and regularly test ideas with users and through data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Turn uncertainty into learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Frame hypotheses, design useful&amp;nbsp;experiments&amp;nbsp;and look for the&amp;nbsp;smallest sensible&amp;nbsp;way to learn whether&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;heading in the right direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Make&amp;nbsp;good product&amp;nbsp;decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Weigh evidence, impact, effort,&amp;nbsp;risk&amp;nbsp;and opportunity when deciding what to pursue - and what not to pursue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Measure whether things are getting better.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Define useful measures of success and use qualitative and quantitative evidence to understand whether our work is having the intended effect.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work iteratively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Help the team deliver in small steps, learn from what happens and adapt rather than treating plans as fixed commitments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Communicate your thinking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Clearly explain problems, evidence, choices,&amp;nbsp;trade-offs&amp;nbsp;and learning to people with&amp;nbsp;very different&amp;nbsp;levels of technical and product knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create strong feedback loops.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Use conversations, demos,&amp;nbsp;reviews&amp;nbsp;and other forums to get useful feedback early rather than presenting finished thinking late.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work as part of a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Create the conditions in which designers, engineers and other specialists can contribute to product decisions rather than treating product management as something the PM does alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Look beyond the product interface.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Understand the wider service, including processes,&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;and teams around it, and recognise when solving a user problem requires changing more than software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience and qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Essential&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Degree-level qualification or equivalent professional experience. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Using creative problem solving to build software solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrate experience working as a Product Manager in a multidisciplinary digital product team, working closely with disciplines such as design, engineering, research and delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience using product discovery alongside delivery - for example, user research, data,&amp;nbsp;experimentation&amp;nbsp;and hypothesis testing - to understand problems and inform what a team should do next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working with significant uncertainty or ambiguity:&amp;nbsp;identifying&amp;nbsp;what is known, what is assumed and what needs to be learned before making larger commitments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience taking complex problems and helping a team turn them into clear priorities,&amp;nbsp;outcomes&amp;nbsp;and practical next steps.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience making product decisions using a combination of user evidence, data, organisational goals, technical&amp;nbsp;constraints&amp;nbsp;and product judgement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience communicating product thinking clearly to a wide range of people, including explaining evidence, uncertainty, trade-offs and why particular decisions have been made.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working collaboratively with people outside the immediate product team, particularly where&amp;nbsp;different groups&amp;nbsp;have&amp;nbsp;different needs,&amp;nbsp;incentives&amp;nbsp;or perspectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Particularly useful&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;d&amp;nbsp;be especially interested in candidates who have experience of one or more of the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working in an organisation going through significant product, digital or organisational transformation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working in complex service environments where improving the user experience involves changes to technology, operations,&amp;nbsp;policy&amp;nbsp;or organisational processes - not simply changing an interface.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Helping teams move towards more iterative, outcome-focused or evidence-led ways of working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working in a mission-led, research, publishing, education, scientific or other knowledge-based organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience of scholarly publishing is useful but&amp;nbsp;isn&#39;t&amp;nbsp;required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;looking for in a Senior Product Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For us, seniority&amp;nbsp;isn&#39;t&amp;nbsp;about having a larger backlog or knowing more product framework:&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;about judgement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be able to take a complex and uncertain problem, help people understand it, decide what we most need to learn, bring a team together around a sensible course of action and change that course when the evidence tells us to.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be comfortable making decisions without perfect information while being clear about the assumptions and risks involved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;And&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;help the people around you think more clearly about the product - not simply tell them what to build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working at PLOS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;join PLOS&#39;s Product team and work collaboratively with colleagues across Digital and the wider organisation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role has no direct line-management responsibility.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The job is fully remote. Some flexibility to work across time zones and occasional national or international travel may be&amp;nbsp;required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range we’ve established for these positions is&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;(UK)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;£65,000 - £73,500&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PLOS also offers a comprehensive benefits package summarized below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;BENEFITS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Life assurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Income protection &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Personal accident insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Pension with up to 10% employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;25 days holidays, market competitive Maternity and Paternity leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Birthday and three winter holidays days off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;2 days paid time off for volunteering per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Fully remote work environment with stipend on joining for home office&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About PLOS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building on a strong legacy of pioneering innovation, PLOS continues to be a catalyst in open science, reimagining models to meet open science principles, removing barriers and promoting inclusion in knowledge creation and sharing, and publishing research outputs that enable everyone to learn from, reuse and build upon scientific knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work is supported by a highly skilled global in-house team, partnerships with local scholarly organizations, and the valued contributions of a diverse, international community of scientific researchers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re committed to equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re working to create a more equitable system of scientific knowledge and understanding. Removing barriers to inclusion and facilitating broad participation of voices is core to our success, inside and out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond accepting distinct perspectives, we seek and support divergent backgrounds among our staff because we know differences strengthen our teams, our work, and our communities. We strongly encourage applicants of all identities to join us as we work towards a future where science is open to all, for all.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit&lt;a href=&quot;http://plos.org/careers&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;plos.org/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;To learn more about how PLOS protects your privacy, see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://plos.org/employee-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ128R110&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to help solve the world’s toughest problems with Data and AI? That’s what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Head of Public Sector - Growth, you’ll partner with a team of accomplished Data, AI and industry specialists. Your mission is to drive the adoption of Databricks across a select group of Public Sector organisations. We’re looking for a proven Enterprise Account Executive to deliver net-new strategic business, bringing an informed point of view on Data and Advanced Analytics. Your insight will shape winning strategies and together with our teams and partners enable you to deliver exceptional value to customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess your accounts and develop a strategy to engage all buying centres, driving deals forward and shortening decision cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools every day to speed up account research, prepare for meetings and plan deals. You&#39;ll build with the Databricks platform yourself, so you understand what customers experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a solution-led approach to create meaningful value for new logo accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close quick wins while managing longer, complex sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a defined list of prospects in UKI and build strategies targeting all critical stakeholders. Build and self-source your own pipeline, and run the full sales cycle from first prospecting to close, keeping your pipeline clean and well maintained&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support broader customer transformation goals through strategic partnerships, well-scoped services, training, and targeted Executive engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong value throughout the sales process to guide successful negotiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate cross-functional teams to maximise impact across your ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the consumption narrative, using demand plans to surface high-value use cases in each account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay customer-centric by delivering both technical and business outcomes through the Databricks Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable joining technical conversations alongside Solutions Architects, and able to position Databricks clearly against competitors (technical knowledge can be developed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong new business development background with a track record of closing and exceeding quota in Public Sector accounts. including building territories and winning new logos, not just managing an inherited book. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating Public Sector procurement frameworks and mechanisms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Builder + AI First mindset: you actively use AI tools to improve your productivity and the quality of your work, and you can show examples beyond simply knowing about them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in Cloud software, open source technology, and/or the Data and AI space, ideally selling into data, analytics, AI or digital transformation programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving adoption of usage-based SaaS services and co-selling with AWS, Azure or Google Cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coachable, curious and committed to continuous learning, with evidence such as certifications or cross-functional projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify key use cases and buying centres to expand Databricks’ value within an organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to business-line leaders, the C-suite and economic buyers. You can explain business outcomes and ROI, not just product features, and you present with confidence to executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building strong champions, collaborative teams and productive partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of consumption-based land-and-expand sales models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust sales methodologies (e.g., account planning, MEDDPICC, Value Selling) and accurate forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated contributions and a consistent track record of success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias for action and a strong sense of ownership. You take initiative well beyond carrying a number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative seller who leads deal teams and mentors others, with a record of success in high-performance, high-accountability cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility for SC clearance (existing clearance is an advantage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is part of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Creative &amp;amp; Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;services. Our team is a vibrant mix of talents, ranging from Creatives, Influencer Marketers, Brand &amp;amp; Content Strategists to Account Managers, Programmatic and Marketing Automation Consultants. Together, we blend imaginative storytelling and performance-driven strategies with cutting-edge technology to create engaging digital experiences that build lasting relationships with our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the commercial engine and primary sparring partner for one of our largest Tech client verticals. You’ll bridge the gap between complex Paid Media strategies and the client’s ambitious growth goals, ensuring our partnership feels less like a vendor and more like an extension of their own leadership team. Your mission is to support driving revenue into a 20% growth success story.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Leadership: Act as the primary business partner for the client, building trust-based relationships at the senior level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth Ownership: Drive a 20% YoY growth target by identifying commercial opportunities in Paid Media, Social Organic, LLM, and Influencer strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Matrix Orchestration: Lead the &quot;Trio&quot; (Account, Program, Strategy), serving as the final decision-maker to ensure delivery matches client expectations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Sparring: Challenge the client and internal teams with &quot;Growth Invention&quot; ideas, moving beyond execution to strategic impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial Governance: Own the P&amp;amp;L, SOWs, and profitability for the Business Group.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Media Pedigree: A deep, must-have understanding of integrated Paid Media (Social, Programmatic, Search).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency DNA: Proven experience managing complex, multi-workstream accounts in a global agency or consultancy environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A confident, outgoing, and positive personality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a natural people person who builds chemistry instantly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenger Mindset: You aren&#39;t afraid to have sensitive conversations or reset expectations when budgets or timings shift.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social Fluency: Experience or strong exposure to Social Organic and Influencer ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, hybrid working policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The choice of medical healthcare providers (Bupa or Medicash)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday plus bank holidays and your birthday off each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EAP scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ride to work scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buddy Program: You will be paired with a ‘Buddy’ to help you through your first weeks’ at DEPT®&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3783 - Senior Associate, Media Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1.15,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate, Media Planning&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;is an essential engine within the MFG Media Planning team, responsible for driving day-to-day campaign tactical planning work across end-to-end (E2E) processes and tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1.15,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In this role, you will ensure all media deliverables are accurate, timely, and comprehensive—moving beyond just the “what” to understand and communicate the “why.” As a multi-tasking professional, you will execute core media operations with increasing independence, spot emerging trends and patterns across campaign data, and actively partner with cross-functional disciplines to help craft solutions and recommended next steps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1.15,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:12,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​Tactical Planning &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End Media Execution: Drive day-to-end planning tasks, including audience research, media plan matrix management, creative spec collation, trafficking coordination, and financial reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tool &amp;amp; Process Proficiency: Utilize core agency and planning platforms (e.g., GWI, Olive, PFC, ad servers) with speed and precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quality Assurance (QA): Ensure operational accuracy across campaign setups, tracking tags, media briefs, and billing milestones before deliverables go out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time &amp;amp; Priority Management: Manage your own daily schedule effectively, prioritizing tasks to consistently meet and exceed deadlines across concurrent campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal Team Partnership: Foster strong collaborative relationships with key discipline counterparts—including Client Services (CS), Activation, Analytics, and Ad Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Discipline Alignment: Proactively initiate conversations across internal teams to troubleshoot issues, gather required inputs, and ensure seamless handoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lateral Management: Work laterally within the pod/discipline team to ensure alignment on campaign milestones and shared project timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Meeting Support &amp;amp; Accountable Follow-Through&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meeting Contribution: Actively participate in internal campaign, tactical, and status meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Action Item Ownership: Partner with Planning Managers to accurately capture meeting notes, open questions, and agreed next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolution Driver: Take accountability for following up on assigned media actions and liaising with stakeholders to obtain timely answers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting, Data QA &amp;amp; Emerging Insights&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting Pull &amp;amp; Verification: Own the compilation and rigorous data QA of regular reporting deliverables (e.g., weekly pacing/performance, DCA inputs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pattern Recognition: Answer tactical, campaign-level questions (e.g., data source timing, pacing variances) and begin identifying noteworthy trends in performance data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution-Oriented Thinking: Help outline initial observations and potential solutions for campaign hurdles alongside your Planning Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuous Learning &amp;amp; Self-Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Category &amp;amp; Discipline Fluency: Deepen your understanding of client Product Areas (PAs), historical campaign performance, competitive context, and audience dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: Continuously refine both written and verbal communication to present technical media details clearly and concisely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What Success Looks Like in this Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;ndependence &amp;amp; Reliability: Accomplishes assigned workflows with high autonomy while maintaining exceptional attention to detail and zero-defect accuracy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Analytical Curiosity: Proactively asks &quot;why did this happen?&quot; rather than solely compiling raw data, beginning to connect data points into actionable insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proactive Communication: Flags potential roadblocks or timing risks early with suggested workarounds rather than waiting for escalation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;9679&quot; data-font=&quot;Raleway,sans-serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;720&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience: 1–2+ years of hands-on media agency experience, preferably within digital media planning, media operations, or campaign management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;9679&quot; data-font=&quot;Raleway,sans-serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;720&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Tools &amp;amp; Platforms: Experience with audience profiling and media research tools (e.g., GWI) and media finance/planning platforms (e.g., Olive, Mediaocean, or equivalent enterprise planning software).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;9679&quot; data-font=&quot;Raleway,sans-serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;720&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Analytical Acumen: Strong proficiency in Google Sheets / Microsoft Excel (formulas, pivot tables, VLOOKUP/XLOOKUP, data reconciliation).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;9679&quot; data-font=&quot;Raleway,sans-serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;720&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Organizational Skills: Proven ability to multitask and manage competing deadlines across multiple workstreams without sacrificing quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-charcodes=&quot;9679&quot; data-font=&quot;Raleway,sans-serif&quot; data-buautonum=&quot;8&quot; data-margin=&quot;720&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Interpersonal Skills: Clear, professional written and verbal communication skills; collaborative mindset with an eagerness to learn and share knowledge.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
