&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3667 - Director, Planning, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The planning team are the guardians of creating industry leading, unrivalled work at WPP Media. We are central conduits to all specialists, striving to push boundaries and have a positive impact on consumers and brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Planning &lt;/strong&gt;to join our growing planning team, to drive forward our planning output and help to create amazing work for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media Planning Craft:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the WPP Media planning output on your specific client to create unrivalled work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to articulate the strategic approach into media behaviours and train and support the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Need strategic thinking on how we utilise tools and specialism outside of planning on response i.e. sources of growth, measurement, learning agenda, data, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build presence outside of current teams and drive visibility of planning team within the wider agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a fresh perspective to planning approaches including the use of different tools, new insights and coach others to challenge the status quo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall responsibility for the development of all planning responses, ensuring we are developing unrivalled work in all executions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead daily running of account ensuring all governances processes are adhered to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage senior client relationships, understanding what they need for their business and how to drive growth for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the planning team of three, ensuring the have clear personal objectives, structure and regular reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Idea creation and storytelling: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop relationship with media owners and look for opportunities to create unrivalled work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an advanced commercial understanding of WPP Media’s products and services. Understanding which are suitable for their clients and how sell in solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a story telling expert, driving added value with the team and quality boosting output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Area Knowledge – Advanced-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrates advanced understanding of the industry as well as future trends. Serves as an internal consultant/expert on at least some tools and technology. Effectively guides junior team members on advanced elements. Works with leadership team to develop new solutions and/or spot new applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving – Advanced -&lt;/strong&gt; Performs complex analyses of a range of information and identifies issues before they become problems; helps others think about how to define or redefine complex problems. Supports business leaders to find solutions and evaluates others’ solutions to determine the best way forward. Understand how to resolve escalated issues and coaches others to problem solve. Manages escalations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management – Advanced -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Capitalizes on deep understanding of (current or potential) client and agency organisational structures, business processes, strategic objectives and challenges in order to anticipate and meet their needs. Demonstrates expert knowledge and monitors the client’s industry in order to create effective solutions. Advises key stakeholders by continuously helping them to successfully navigate through critical business changes.​​​​​​​ Uses strong deep expertise and contextual awareness to explore complex issues with stakeholders and provide trusted advice, deliverables and campaign KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective Communication – Advanced -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Leads the delivery of relevant and accurate information to drive maximum impact. Consistently delivers communications to influence and educate all levels of seniority, appropriately judging the demands of the situation. Creatively develops presentations and comms to help with the understanding/education of complex information. Guides others on the best practices and approaches for creating clear, concise and organized communication materials to convey plans in a user-friendly way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Management – Expert -&lt;/strong&gt; Sets the standard for accuracy and thoroughness so that sufficiently detailed information is logged correctly.&amp;nbsp; Balances short-term considerations with long-term goals and ensures that critical deliverables are met.&amp;nbsp; Manages multiple overlapping timelines and competing demands, weighing the needs of different stakeholders across the business to determine priorities for parallel projects and sets priorities according to business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compelling storytelling – Advanced -&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and direct the creation of a story, taking into account client knowledge levels and needs. Applies deep expertise and sound judgement to persuade key decision makers on recommendation, considering all implications. Designs differentiated communications (content focus, style, presentation, etc.) for various internal and external audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideas Creation – Expert -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Develops strategies to bring new technologies, innovations and products to life.&amp;nbsp; Challenges the client and team in innovating and designing new solutions, methods and products to remain competitive and lead the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comms Planning – Advanced -&lt;/strong&gt; High technical knowledge of all media touchpoints as well as how they interplay and future trends.&amp;nbsp; Serves as a consultant and quality controls plans, strategies and frameworks that leave the building.&amp;nbsp; Strategic learnings and insights about business impact (not just media metrics).&amp;nbsp; Development of directional media strategy/platform.&amp;nbsp; Developing comms planning skills amongst wider community.&amp;nbsp; Looks for alternative solutions to problems and constantly challenges received norms in a spirit of positive provocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3710 - Director, Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Strategy Director for OpenConnect, you will be the driving force behind the strategic comms planning output across BT Group’s complete brand portfolio, spanning consumer powerhouses (EE, BT, Plusnet) and BT Business. Reporting directly to the VP/Head of Strategy &amp;amp; Comms Planning, you will take operational charge of the planning floor, transforming upstream business logic into world-class, insight-led comms strategies that inspire both creative agency partners and senior client marketers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is purpose-built to transform our day-to-day strategic craft. Historically, our challenge has been moving beyond tactical execution, mechanical planning, and dense data slides. Your mandate is to revolutionise our narrative storytelling, unearth genuinely motivating human and cultural insights, and package complex strategies into crisp, executive-ready presentations that command authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting at the intersection of media, data, and creative, you will ensure our strategies are not just written, but deployed, partnering seamlessly with creative agencies across the BT Group roster to deliver unified, culture-shaping work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevating the Strategic Output&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the Comms Output: Take direct ownership of the quality, consistency, and rigour of all comms planning deliverables emerging from the planning cohort across EE, BT, Plusnet, and BT Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;From Information to Insight: Move the team away from surface-level observations and data dumping. Unearth sharp, tension-led insights (category, cultural, consumer, and company) that unlock unexpected media behaviors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 1 Architecture: Translate Stage 0 portfolio growth strategies into clear, actionable comms ecosystems, defining distinct role-for-channel tasks, full-funnel journeys, and Get/To/By frameworks that guide activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Applied Strategy Mandate: Champion applied discipline over theoretical deck-building. Ensure strategies actively steer media channel choices, investment weights, and creative formats (&quot;If our strategy isn’t actionable, it’s useless&quot;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Packaging &amp;amp; Narrative Storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rewriting the Narrative: Radically elevate the standard of strategic storytelling across the team. Replace tactical, jargon-heavy decks with compelling, commercially grounded narratives that captivate marketing directors and executive leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Packaging: Master the art of the synthesis. Package complex media systems, technical mechanics, and multi-brand nuances into succinct, punchy, C-suite ready narratives that clearly articulate the &quot;So What?&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visual &amp;amp; Verbal Clarity: Coach the planning cohort on visual layout, storyline momentum, and presentation delivery, setting a new benchmark for what an OpenConnect strategic deliverable looks and feels like.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Agency Partnership &amp;amp; Ecosystem Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inter-Agency Roster Leadership: Act as a strategic partner to creative and BT strategists across the BT Group roster. Build collaborative, high-trust working relationships that dismantle agency silos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upstream Creative Collaboration: Where possible, engage early in the creative development cycle to influence ideation, ensuring creative platforms and media channel architectures complement, push, and amplify each other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge the Creative/Media Divide: Serve as the connective tissue between creative ambition and media capability, co-developing unified campaign playbooks where media environments make the creative idea unmissable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Brand &amp;amp; Enterprise Breadth (Consumer + B2B)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumer Portfolio Rigour: Maintain clear distinction, tone, and strategic guardrails across consumer brands, ensuring EE, BT, and Plusnet execute with distinct roles without internal friction or audience overlap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BT Business Acceleration: Partner with the enterprise leads to bring consumer-grade storytelling, behavioural insight, and dynamic comms planning into the B2B space (SMEs, Corporate, and Public Sector).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Pollination: Identify shared learnings, testing frameworks, and effectiveness benchmarks across consumer campaigns and adapt them strategically for BT Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Upskilling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arms around the team: Actively mentor, manage, and coach planners in the team, transforming them from reactive brief-takers into proactive strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support on comms planning culture within the Open Connect team, bringing planners together in weekly council sessions, leading stretch sessions, training etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed Best Practice: Institutionalise consistent comms planning toolkits, framing templates, and insight-mining methodologies across the entire account team; get them using the data at our fingertips, always looking beyond TGI!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instill Strategic Confidence: Build a team culture anchored in conviction, strategic bravery, and clear point-of-view, empowering planners to defend ideas and challenge client briefs with commercial intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Comms Planning clout:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in senior Comms Strategy/planning, Connections Planning, or Integrated Strategy roles within top-tier media or creative agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Storyteller&lt;/strong&gt;: Exceptional ability to distill messy, highly technical, and data-dense inputs into elegant, high-impact stories tailored for CMOs and Marketing Directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight Hunter&lt;/strong&gt;: Demonstrated ability to find provocative, emotionally resonant human truths and cultural tensions that unlock fresh creative media solutions, not just reporting what the data says, but proving why it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative Fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: Experienced working alongside top creative agency strategy leads, with the diplomacy, creative vocabulary, and collaborative skill to shape work jointly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2C &amp;amp; B2B Versatility:&lt;/strong&gt; Consumer comms experience combined with the intellectual curiosity and agility to tackle the complex, account-based nuances of BT Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Player: &lt;/strong&gt;Natural mentor who loves developing planners, raising team morale through their positivity, enthusiasm and energy, to support building an environment of strategic excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2565 - Digital Associate Director, Media Planning, Global Client Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;The role:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Account Director (Digital Planning &amp;amp; Activation)&lt;/strong&gt; is a senior client leadership role responsible for overseeing &lt;strong&gt;digital media planning and activation delivery for Electronic Arts (EA)&lt;/strong&gt; across biddable and platform‑led channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role operates at the centre of EA’s &lt;strong&gt;hub‑and‑spoke delivery model&lt;/strong&gt;, working closely with &lt;strong&gt;central planning and activation teams&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;local market teams&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure digital strategies are planned holistically and activated consistently across markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends &lt;strong&gt;digital planning leadership, activation governance, and client partnership&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring EA’s objectives are translated into effective digital plans and best‑in‑class execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope of Channels (Digital‑First)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Director is accountable for &lt;strong&gt;digital planning and activation leadership&lt;/strong&gt; across:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programmatic Display &amp;amp; Video&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online Video &amp;amp; CTV&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Social&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DSP‑ and platform‑led digital media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data‑ and audience‑driven digital planning and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Planning Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;digital media planning oversight&lt;/strong&gt; across EA scopes, ensuring plans are:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically sound&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligned to EA business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feasible for activation across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with central planning teams to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape digital channel strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define budget allocation and channel roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align planning outputs with activation realities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure digital planning considerations are clearly communicated and understood by local markets and activation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Activation Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own senior oversight of &lt;strong&gt;digital activation delivery&lt;/strong&gt; across EA markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure digital plans are translated into &lt;strong&gt;clear, executable activation frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign structure, activation logic, timelines, and delivery quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as senior escalation point for &lt;strong&gt;digital delivery, performance, or operational risks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure digital best practices and governance standards are applied consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Central &amp;amp; Local Market Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the &lt;strong&gt;primary bridge between central teams and local markets&lt;/strong&gt; for digital planning and activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with central planning and activation leadership to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define digital frameworks and ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain consistency across markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local markets to:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align global and regional digital strategies to local market requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support planning interpretation and activation feasibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure local insights and constraints inform both planning and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance global consistency with local flexibility across digital activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Partnership &amp;amp; Digital Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a &lt;strong&gt;trusted senior digital planning and activation partner&lt;/strong&gt; to EA stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead digital discussions across:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy and planning alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activation approach and platform selection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance, optimisation, and learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulate digital trade‑offs, constraints, and opportunities to EA clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support test‑and‑learn and optimisation frameworks across planning and activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance, Measurement &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure digital plans and activation deliver against EA KPIs and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain oversight of pacing, optimisation priorities, and delivery performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with measurement and analytics teams to ensure:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital reporting clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent performance interpretation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure governance is maintained across platforms, partners, and markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Operational Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own commercial accountability across &lt;strong&gt;digital planning and activation scopes&lt;/strong&gt;, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PO management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance process adherence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting and cost control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with finance and operations teams to ensure:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurate billing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent financial management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment between planning assumptions and activation delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business cases and staffing justification linked to digital delivery needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior leadership across digital planning and activation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity on ownership, responsibilities, and decision‑making within a matrixed model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support capability development in digital planning and activation best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion EA digital ways of working across central and local teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a &lt;strong&gt;digital planning and activation leadership role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;digital media planning and biddable activation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing &lt;strong&gt;complex, multi‑market digital scopes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and operational leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;global entertainment, gaming, or technology clients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating within &lt;strong&gt;hub‑and‑spoke or global/regional delivery models&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with platform‑heavy and performance‑led digital environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Behaviours&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic yet delivery‑focused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm and credible under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially rigorous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and pragmatic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident decision‑maker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports into: Senior Client / Business Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key stakeholders:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EA global, regional, and market teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central digital planning and activation leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local market planning and activation teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance, operations, and platform partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
